IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `roc-core`
IMPORT `roc5-o22-sheriff`

-- TESTS for roc5-o22-sheriff.l4 (Order 22, rules 6 to 9).  Every expected value is written from the text of the
-- Rules (lines 3449 to 3528 of the raw file), beside the assertion, before the module was run.
-- A "last day" below is a made-up answer of O 3 r 3 (seam S-T1).  The regulative rules are run by #TRACE in the module
-- (FULFILLED at day 14 and 7, BREACH at day 15 and 8); a trace prints its result and is not assertable on this build.

§ `Tests -- Order 22, rules 6 to 9`

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 6 (1) to (3)`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(1) the Sheriff must carry out the terms of the enforcement order in the sequence indicated` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- "(if any)"
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(1) the Sheriff must carry out the terms of the enforcement order in the sequence indicated` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(1) the Sheriff determines the time, place and manner of carrying out the enforcement order` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(1) the Sheriff determines the time, place and manner of carrying out the enforcement order` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(1) the Sheriff may exercise the power relating to forced entry into premises` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(1) the Sheriff may exercise the power relating to forced entry into premises` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- "If no sequence of enforcement is indicated"
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(2) the Sheriff may carry out the terms in any order and sequentially or concurrently` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(2) the Sheriff may carry out the terms in any order and sequentially or concurrently` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(3) the enforcement applicant or its solicitor or other authorised representative must accompany the Sheriff` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(3) the enforcement applicant or its solicitor or other authorised representative must accompany the Sheriff` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
§§ `Rule 6(4) -- how an enforcement order is carried out`
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(a) an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(a) taking physical possession of the movable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(a) an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(a) affixing the Sheriff's seal on the movable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(b) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of movable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(i) affixing the Sheriff's seal on the movable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(b) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of movable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(ii) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity having possession or control of the movable property or leaving a notice of seizure at the place where the movable property was seized` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) posting a notice of seizure on some conspicuous part of the immovable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) entering and taking possession of the immovable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) serving a notice of seizure on the persons who are present and in actual possession or control of the immovable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(d) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(d) serving a notice of seizure on the Singapore Land Authority in respect of title to the immovable property` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(d) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the enforcement applicant separately registering the enforcement order within 14 days after service of the notice of seizure` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(d) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(ii) the enforcement applicant giving notice in writing to the Sheriff that the enforcement order has been duly registered` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(e) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from a non-party that is a financial institution as represented by a deposit of money` `o 22 r 6(4)(e) serving a notice of attachment on the financial institution in respect of the deposit in such institution` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(f) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from any other non-party` `o 22 r 6(4)(f) serving a notice of attachment on the non-party from which money is due to the enforcement respondent` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(g) an enforcement order for seizure and sale of bonds, shares or other securities or membership in a club or society` `o 22 r 6(4)(g) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity which registers the ownership or the membership` EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a step the paragraph lists for another kind of order
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(a) an enforcement order for delivery or possession of movable property` `o 22 r 6(4)(b)(ii) serving a notice of seizure on the person or entity having possession or control of the movable property or leaving a notice of seizure at the place where the movable property was seized` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(e) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from a non-party that is a financial institution as represented by a deposit of money` `o 22 r 6(4)(f) serving a notice of attachment on the non-party from which money is due to the enforcement respondent` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(f) an enforcement order for attachment of a debt due from any other non-party` `o 22 r 6(4)(e) serving a notice of attachment on the financial institution in respect of the deposit in such institution` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4)(c) an enforcement order for the possession of immovable property` `o 22 r 6(4) another step` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4) the Sheriff carries out the enforcement order by the step` `o 22 r 6(4) another enforcement order` `o 22 r 6(4)(a) taking physical possession of the movable property` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the period for registering the enforcement order`'s `period length` EQUALS 14
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the enforcement order is registered in time` (Date 14 7 2027) (Date 14 7 2027) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `o 22 r 6(4)(d)(i) the enforcement order is registered in time` (Date 15 7 2027) (Date 14 7 2027) EQUALS JUST FALSE

